[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 87 A car crash",
    "start": 0.71,
    "end": 4.672,
    "zh": "第87课 一场车祸",
    "zh_hant": "第87課 一場車禍"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Listen to the tape then",
    "start": 5.493,
    "end": 8.434,
    "zh": "听录音，然后",
    "zh_hant": "聽錄音，然後"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "answer this question.",
    "start": 8.254,
    "end": 10.155,
    "zh": "回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "Can the mechanics repair Mr. Wood's car?",
    "start": 11.336,
    "end": 15.337,
    "zh": "机械师能修好伍德先生的汽车吗？",
    "zh_hant": "機械師能修好伍德先生的汽車嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "Is my car ready yet?",
    "start": 17.339,
    "end": 19.54,
    "zh": "我的汽车修好了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "我的汽車修好了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "I don't know, sir.",
    "start": 20.24,
    "end": 21.961,
    "zh": "我不知道，先生。",
    "zh_hant": "我不知道，先生。"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "What's the number of your car?",
    "start": 22.201,
    "end": 24.882,
    "zh": "您的汽车牌照号是多少？",
    "zh_hant": "您的汽車牌照號是多少？"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "It's LFZ",
    "start": 25.563,
    "end": 27.744,
    "zh": "是LFZ",
    "zh_hant": "是LFZ"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "312 G.",
    "start": 30.283,
    "end": 31.085,
    "zh": "312G。",
    "zh_hant": "312G。"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "When did you bring it to us?",
    "start": 32.186,
    "end": 34.667,
    "zh": "您什么时候把它送来的？",
    "zh_hant": "您什麼時候把它送來的？"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "I brought it here three days ago.",
    "start": 35.588,
    "end": 38.549,
    "zh": "我是三天前送来的。",
    "zh_hant": "我是三天前送來的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "Ah yes, I remember now.",
    "start": 39.109,
    "end": 42.191,
    "zh": "啊，是的，我现在记起来了。",
    "zh_hant": "啊，是的，我現在記起來了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Have your mechanics finished yet?",
    "start": 42.892,
    "end": 45.833,
    "zh": "您的机械师们修好了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "您的機械師們修好了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "No, they're still working on it.",
    "start": 46.273,
    "end": 49.195,
    "zh": "没有，他们还在修呢。",
    "zh_hant": "沒有，他們還在修呢。"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Let's go into the garage",
    "start": 49.535,
    "end": 52.176,
    "zh": "我们到修车厂去吧",
    "zh_hant": "我們到修車廠去吧"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "and have a look at it.",
    "start": 51.956,
    "end": 54.117,
    "zh": "去看一看它。",
    "zh_hant": "去看一看它。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Isn't that your car?",
    "start": 55.718,
    "end": 57.879,
    "zh": "这不是您的车吗？",
    "zh_hant": "這不是您的車嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "Well, it was my car.",
    "start": 58.759,
    "end": 62.081,
    "zh": "唔，这曾经是我的车。",
    "zh_hant": "唔，這曾經是我的車。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "Didn't you have a crash?",
    "start": 62.421,
    "end": 64.842,
    "zh": "您不是出车祸了吗？",
    "zh_hant": "您不是出車禍了嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "That's right.",
    "start": 65.243,
    "end": 66.603,
    "zh": "没错。",
    "zh_hant": "沒錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "I drove it into a lamp-post.",
    "start": 67.084,
    "end": 70.005,
    "zh": "我把它撞到一根灯柱上了。",
    "zh_hant": "我把它撞到一根燈柱上了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "Can your mechanics repair it?",
    "start": 70.345,
    "end": 73.026,
    "zh": "您的机械师能修好它吗？",
    "zh_hant": "您的機械師能修好它嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "Well, they're trying to repair it, sir.",
    "start": 73.507,
    "end": 76.768,
    "zh": "唔，他们正在尽力修，先生。",
    "zh_hant": "唔，他們正在盡力修，先生。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "But to tell you the truth, you need a new",
    "start": 76.948,
    "end": 80.962,
    "zh": "但实话告诉您，您需要一辆新车",
    "zh_hant": "但實話告訴您，您需要一輛新車"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "car!",
    "start": 80.664,
    "end": 81.608,
    "zh": "了！",
    "zh_hant": "了！"
  }
]
